      "message": "Funnily, when looking at this code in Gerrit, I at first thought that is was a bug to not extend the value from 8 bits to 32 bits (setting aside C auto-promote to `int`), so it also took me a little while to re-discover that it operates within a 8-bit value.  So definitely, yes, this needs a comment.\n\nI remeber thinking if I should try to decode the value into a 64-bit integer, and then checking if it exceeded 32 bits, but that would be ill prepared for the case of the valid width later being expanded to 64 bits.",
